{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"b67faf546ca6c8e9267af60ec80d01e9f3162adf0ab41885788a4f3c439d8365","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira Data Center transport adapter","key_entities":["adapters/jira_datacenter/retry.py","adapters/jira_datacenter/transport.py","_with_connection_retry","_call_logged","_paged_search","get_issuelinks_map","get_comment_map","get_parent_map","parse_retry_after","MAX_BACKOFF_S","BackendHTTPError","rate_limit_retry","exc.response.headers","_RETRY_AFTER_JITTER"],"problem_keywords":["rate limiting","retry","429","Retry-After","Jira Data Center","idempotent reads","backoff","jitter"],"propositions":["HTTP 429 responses with Retry-After headers on idempotent reads are retried with jitter (up to 20%) applied and delay clamped to MAX_BACKOFF_S","429 responses without Retry-After headers degrade gracefully and behave as before","All mutation call sites (create_issue, update_issue, add_comment, add_label, etc.) fail immediately on 429 with no retry","The rate_limit_retry opt-in flag defaults to False on _with_connection_retry, _call_logged, and _paged_search to prevent implicit retry inheritance","Both code paths (via _paged_search through _call_logged, and direct _with_connection_retry calls) properly carry and forward the rate_limit_retry flag","Cap exhaustion raises BackendHTTPError with code 429, never the vendor JIRAError type, at the adapter boundary"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787320771656770001,"uuid":"f1285ba8-eab6-4500-adb0-bab797a00486"}